# Entry point on the Pixel 9 (tokay, zumapro): init loads init.recovery.${ro.hardware}.rc,
# which pulls in the SoC file, same as stock recovery does. Stock that is
# init.recovery.zumapro.rc; in this recovery ro.board.platform comes from our own
# prop.default (zuma), so this imports our init.recovery.zuma.rc (Google's
# zumapro and zuma recovery rc files are identical).
import /init.recovery.${ro.board.platform}.rc
